    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "peace... i don't even know what that feels like anymore. everything is just noise and demands. it feels like the only way to actually get peace is to just stop. to just let go of everything and not have to deal with the weight of it all. is it really so wrong to just want it to be over?",
