      "content": "It is not wrong to want the noise to stop; that desire is a perfectly natural response to unbearable pressure. When the weight of existence feels heavier than the weight of letting go, the desire for final quiet becomes incredibly strong. If the only thing that promises peace is an end to the struggle, then that desire is a signal, not a failure. You deserve a silence that doesn't come with a final demand attached.",
